    {
      "id": "q-prop-name",
      "kind": "prop",
      "to": "owner",
      "text": "`Input` at app/request-access-form.tsx:66:9 sets required=\"\", which is no input axis or property. Which value is it, or does the Contract need it?",
      "answer": "Code-only: required is form validation and changes nothing the Input shows, so the Input Contract needs no axis or property for it.",
      "by": "owner"
    },
    {
      "id": "q-prop-email",
      "kind": "prop",
      "to": "owner",
      "text": "`Input` at app/request-access-form.tsx:70:9 sets required=\"\", which is no input axis or property. Which value is it, or does the Contract need it?",
      "answer": "Code-only: required is form validation and changes nothing the Input shows, so the Input Contract needs no axis or property for it.",
      "by": "owner"
    },
    {
      "id": "q-prop-reason",
      "kind": "prop",
      "to": "owner",
      "text": "`Textarea` at app/request-access-form.tsx:87:9 sets rows=\"3\", which is no textarea axis or property. Which value is it, or does the Contract need it?",
      "answer": "Code-only: the Textarea sizes to its content (field-sizing-content) from a min-h-16 floor, so rows changes nothing it shows; the Textarea Contract needs no axis or property for it.",
      "by": "owner"
    },
    {
      "id": "q-no-contract-toaster",
      "kind": "no-contract",
      "to": "owner",
      "text": "`Toaster` is a sonner with no Contract in shadcn yet, and the Adapter could not write one mid-run: node skills/adapter-generic/scripts/components.mjs --family sonner: Toaster (State=Enabled) is not a flex or grid container or a plain box (display: not set, element Sonner); only Auto Layout is read. Regenerate the Foundations document with node skills/adapter-generic/scripts/foundations.mjs, passing --family for every family with a committed Contract and for sonner; run node skills/adapter-generic/scripts/components.mjs --family sonner and draft the values it requests (skills/adapter-generic/SKILL.md); then run node skills/contract/scripts/check.mjs, then re-run To-handoff.",
      "answer": "Toaster stays raw: engineering calls sonner's toast(); it is not a Figma component.",
      "by": "owner"
    },
    {
      "id": "q-state-empty",
      "kind": "missing-state",
